OL,3,AUK and EU agree draft deal to scrap
OL,4,ABrexit red tape over food exports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe food deal is the most significant
OL,7,Fpart of the so-called Brexit reset
OL,8,Fagreed so far, removing checks and red
OL,9,Ftape that hit exporters after the UK
OL,10,Fexited the EU's single market.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
