OL,3,AKing addressing Commonwealth leaders as
OL,4,APalace says he will speak with 'sorrow'
OL,5,Aabout slave trade
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III is about to formally
OL,8,Fopen the Commonwealth Heads of
OL,9,FGovernment Meeting (Chogm) in Antigua
OL,10,Fand Barbuda - you can watch live above
OL,12,FBuckingham Palace says the King will
OL,13,Fspeak with "unflinching honesty" and
OL,14,F"sincere sorrow" about the lasting pain
OL,15,Fof the transatlantic slave trade
OL,17,FIt will be a tough room for the King,
OL,18,Fthe reception will likely be polite but
OL,19,Friddled with underlying issues, our
OL,20,Fsenior royal correspondent writes
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
