OL,3,AKing addressing Commonwealth leaders as
OL,4,APalace says he will speak with 'sorrow'
OL,5,Aabout slave trade
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlso in attendance will be British
OL,8,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who says
OL,9,Fhe is "open" to a formal apology from
OL,10,Fthe UK over slavery, but said
OL,11,Freparations were "not the right answer"
OL,13,FAs part of talks with fellow leaders,
OL,14,FBurnham is expected to set out plans
OL,15,Ffor a "debt reset" to support
OL,16,FCommonwealth countries dealing with the
OL,17,Fgrowing cost of paying interest
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
