OL,3,AKing addressing Commonwealth leaders as
OL,4,APalace says he will speak with 'sorrow'
OL,5,Aabout slave trade
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Commonwealth leaders' summit is
OL,8,Fheld every two years and allows leaders
OL,9,Fand representatives of the 56 nations
OL,10,Fto discuss the future of the
OL,11,Fpartnership
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
