OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian island ahead of
OL,4,Amidterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has carried out strikes on
OL,7,FIran's Qeshm Island in the Strait of
OL,8,FHormuz, US officials have told CBS, the
OL,9,FBBC's US partner.
OL,11,FThe officials described the strikes as
OL,12,Flimited and defensive, and said they
OL,13,Fwere in response to Iran's Islamic
OL,14,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) firing
OL,15,Fon a US aircraft.
OL,17,FIranian state news agency Irna reported
OL,18,Fexplosions on Qeshm on Monday. The IRGC
OL,19,Fdid not comment but said its forces had
OL,20,Fshot down two US MQM-170 drones south
OL,21,Fof the island and a US MQ-9 drone east
OL,22,Fof the Strait of Hormuz.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
