OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian island ahead of
OL,4,Amidterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US military has not commented on
OL,7,Fthe strikes, which came as mediators
OL,8,Fstepped up their efforts to prevent a
OL,9,Freturn to all-out war after the US
OL,10,Fmidterm elections on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
