OL,3,ATwo Ryanair planes searched after
OL,4,Alanding in Rome as suspected bomb
OL,5,Athreats hit series of flights
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Ryanair planes have been searched
OL,8,Fafter landing in Rome after suspected
OL,9,Fbomb threats hit a series of flights in
OL,10,FEurope
OL,12,FOne of the planes - a flight from
OL,13,FDublin - was escorted by the Italian
OL,14,FAir Force, writes our Europe reporter
OL,16,FEarlier, four other flights landed at
OL,17,FEuropean airports after being targeted
OL,18,Fby suspected threats
OL,20,FTwo of the flights were inspected in
OL,21,FWarsaw, including one that had set off
OL,22,Ffrom London Heathrow
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
