OL,5,Athreats hit series of flights
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother plane that departed Manchester
OL,8,Fwas inspected in Murcia, Spain, where a
OL,9,Flocal official said no explosives were
OL,10,Ffound on the plane
OL,12,FOn Monday, a flight from London Luton
OL,13,Fto Sofia made an emergency landing in
OL,14,FBudapest, following a bomb threat
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
