OL,3,AIndian tourist killed after two
OL,4,Ahelicopters collide near Everest base
OL,5,Acamp
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Indian tourist has died after two
OL,8,Fhelicopters collided while attempting
OL,9,Fto land near the base camp of Mount
OL,10,FEverest, two officials have confirmed
OL,11,Fto the BBC.
OL,13,FVerified footage of the crash showed
OL,14,Fthe helicopter blades of the two
OL,15,Faircraft clipping each other as they
OL,16,Fcame into land at around 08:15 local
OL,17,Ftime (02:30 GMT) in Pheriche,
OL,18,Fapproximately 12km (7 miles) south of
OL,19,FMount Everest Base Camp.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
