OL,3,AIndian tourist killed after two
OL,4,Ahelicopters collide near Everest base
OL,5,Acamp
OL,6,
OL,7,FHelicopter company Fishtail Air named
OL,8,Fthe man killed in the crash as Vasanth
OL,9,FKumar Balaramudu.
OL,11,FThe helicopter company said one of its
OL,12,Fvehicles was involved in the collision
OL,13,Fand that another passenger and the
OL,14,Fhelicopter's captain had been injured.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
